{"availability":"available","full":"qiaeru/couplecards","name":"couplecards","description":"A self-hosted web app that lets couples draw activity cards to break the routine and spice up their daily lives.","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":66,"forks":1,"created":"2026-04-23T19:17:58Z","updated":"2026-10-01T02:10:43Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://couplecards.qiaeru.com","topics":["couples","docker","docker-compose","fastify","pwa","self-hosted"],"demo":"https://couplecards.qiaeru.com/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T20:12:59.756Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-07T20:12:59.756Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-07T20:12:59.756Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T19:22:10.645Z","stars":66,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-07T20:12:59.756Z","stars":66,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Node.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A self-hosted web app that lets couples draw activity cards to break the routine and spice up their daily lives.","The deck is split into two piles, \"Home\" and \"Outdoor\". Each instance has one administrator and as many player accounts as you want. The admin can create accounts directly, or open public registration so anyone can sign up from the login page. In practice a couple often shares a single account.","Self-hosted, your call on sign-ups. Start it, sign in, then create accounts or open public registration from the admin panel. There is no telemetry and no external network call at runtime."],"features":["Two piles, one ritual. The deck splits into a \"Home\" pile and an \"Outdoor\" pile. Tap a pile, the top card flips with a foil-shimmer reveal, and a swipe sends it back to the deck or bans it from future draws.","Personal deck memory. Each player gets their own history, their own ban list, and a low-pile warning when a stack runs thin. Banned cards can be restored with one tap. Drawing a second time from the same pile returns…","Accounts your way. The built-in admin creates accounts for each player, or opens public registration so people sign up themselves from the login page. The admin also manages the shared card library (create, edit, ban,…","Responsive PWA, five languages. French, English, German, Italian, and Spanish all ship out of the box. Works on phone, tablet, and desktop with a dark theme, a foil-and-glow visual language, full keyboard and…","Backend. Node.js 24 and Fastify 5, with SQLite through the built-in node:sqlite module. The entire database is a single file on disk (var/couplecards.db). Password hashing uses hash-wasm (pure WebAssembly), so nothing…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/qiaeru/couplecards/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"f0c25773748153ee619e97edda6809ee1dd4922af5db79f41af3aab8ccfc6216","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:10.779Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:10.779Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A self-hosted web app that lets couples draw activity cards to break the routine and spice up their daily lives.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/qiaeru/couplecards/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"The admin can create accounts directly, or open public registration so anyone can sign up from the login page.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/qiaeru/couplecards/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Start it, sign in, then create accounts or open public registration from the admin panel.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/qiaeru/couplecards/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"f0c25773748153ee619e97edda6809ee1dd4922af5db79f41af3aab8ccfc6216","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/qiaeru/couplecards/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:10.779Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-01T02:10:43Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/qiaeru/couplecards/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:10.780Z","hash":"f0c25773748153ee619e97edda6809ee1